        'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Wilhelm_Conrad_R%C3%B6ntgen_%281888-1900%29%2C_88374_p.jpg/500px-Wilhelm_Conrad_R%C3%B6ntgen_%281888-1900%29%2C_88374_p.jpg',
      actions:
        'Discovered X-rays in 1895 by covering a cathode-ray tube with black cardboard, noticing that invisible rays could pass through solid objects and expose photographic plates to show bone structures.',
